#: main.ts:116 main.ts:126
msgid "Shader upscaling needs GPU rendering: turn on Video ▸ GPU Rendering (Experimental), then restart the player."
msgstr "着色器超分辨率需要 GPU 渲染：请打开“视频 ▸ GPU 渲染（实验性）”，然后重启播放器。"

#. {} is the player's own message, in English.
#: main.ts:120
msgid "Shader upscaling needs GPU rendering, which cannot be turned on here: {}"
msgstr "着色器超分辨率需要 GPU 渲染，但本机无法开启 GPU 渲染：{}"

#: main.ts:124
msgid "GPU rendering stopped during this run: restart the player to use shader upscaling."
msgstr "GPU 渲染在本次运行中已停止：请重启播放器以使用着色器超分辨率。"

#: main.ts:125
msgid "GPU rendering is on from the next start: restart the player to use shader upscaling."
msgstr "GPU 渲染将在下次启动时开启：请重启播放器以使用着色器超分辨率。"

#: main.ts:130
msgid "HQ"
msgstr "高画质"

#: main.ts:130
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "快速"

#. {} are the mode (A, B, C, A+A, B+B, C+A) and the quality (Fast or HQ).
#: main.ts:136
msgid "Anime4K mode {} ({})"
msgstr "Anime4K 模式 {}（{}）"

#: main.ts:194
msgid "Shader Upscaling: a shader did not compile"
msgstr "着色器超分辨率：有着色器编译失败"

#: main.ts:205
msgid "Shader Upscaling: Off"
msgstr "着色器超分辨率：关"

#. {} is the preset, for example "Anime4K mode A (Fast)".
#: main.ts:214
msgid "Shader Upscaling: On, {}"
msgstr "着色器超分辨率：开，{}"

#: main.ts:217
msgid "Shader Upscaling needs GPU rendering"
msgstr "着色器超分辨率需要 GPU 渲染"

#: main.ts:246
msgid "Not available"
msgstr "无法使用"

#: main.ts:247
msgid "Off"
msgstr "关"

#: main.ts:250
msgid "Not running: the player ended abnormally while shaders were drawing"
msgstr "未运行：播放器上次在着色器绘制时异常结束"

#. {} is the player's own message, in English; it says for how long.
#: main.ts:254
msgid "Your choice applies when the player allows shaders again; consider a preset that is not marked demanding. The player says: {}"
msgstr "你的选择会在播放器重新允许着色器时生效；可以考虑选择一个未标为“高负载”的预设。播放器的说明：{}"

#. {} is the preset, for example "Anime4K mode A (Fast)".
#: main.ts:263
msgid "On: {}"
msgstr "开：{}"

#: main.ts:272
msgid "On, but a shader did not compile"
msgstr "开，但有着色器编译失败"

#. {} is mpv's compiler message, in English.
#: main.ts:276
msgid "The player cannot tell whose shader failed when other plugins add shaders too. Its message: {}"
msgstr "其他插件也添加了着色器时，播放器无法判断是谁的着色器失败。播放器的消息：{}"

#: main.ts:282 main.ts:291
msgid "On, but not applied"
msgstr "开，但未生效"

#. {} is the player's own message, in English.
#: main.ts:286
msgid "Other plugins' shaders leave no room: at most 16 shaders run at once. {}"
msgstr "其他插件的着色器已占满：同时最多运行 16 个着色器。{}"

#: main.ts:297
msgid "On: applying…"
msgstr "开：正在应用…"

#: main.ts:299
msgid "On: applies when a video plays"
msgstr "开：播放视频时生效"

#: main.ts:307
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

#. {} is the mode (A+A, B+B or C+A).
#: main.ts:312
msgid "Mode {} (demanding)"
msgstr "模式 {}（高负载）"

#. {} is the mode (A, B or C).
#: main.ts:317
msgid "Mode {}"
msgstr "模式 {}"

#: main.ts:322
msgid "Quality"
msgstr "画质"

#: main.ts:324
msgid "HQ (demanding): large networks, fast GPU"
msgstr "高画质（高负载）：大网络，需要较快的 GPU"

#: main.ts:324
msgid "Fast: smaller networks, most GPUs"
msgstr "快速：小网络，适合大多数 GPU"

#: main.ts:335
msgid "Mode A: for most 1080p anime and blurry older or SD anime. Restores lines and removes blur, noise and compression smear; can strengthen ringing or banding already in the video."
msgstr "模式 A：适合大多数 1080p 动画，以及模糊的老动画或标清动画。修复线条，去除模糊、噪点和压缩涂抹；视频中已有的振铃或色带可能被加强。"

#: main.ts:338
msgid "Mode B: for most 720p anime and anime downscaled from 1080p. A softer restore that also reduces ringing and aliasing; some blur may stay."
msgstr "模式 B：适合大多数 720p 动画和由 1080p 缩小的动画。修复较柔和，同时减少振铃和锯齿；可能残留一些模糊。"

#: main.ts:341
msgid "Mode C: for clean sources with little blur, such as anime downscaled to 480p. Upscales with denoising and stays closest to the source."
msgstr "模式 C：适合模糊很少的干净片源，例如缩小到 480p 的动画。放大时降噪，最接近原片。"

#: main.ts:344
msgid "Mode A+A (demanding): mode A with a second restore pass: the sharpest lines, but it can ring, band or alias. Only when the video is enlarged 2× or more."
msgstr "模式 A+A（高负载）：模式 A 再加一遍修复：线条最锐利，但可能出现振铃、色带或锯齿。仅在视频放大 2 倍或以上时使用。"

#: main.ts:346
msgid "Mode B+B (demanding): mode B with a second soft restore pass. Only when the video is enlarged 2× or more."
msgstr "模式 B+B（高负载）：模式 B 再加一遍柔和修复。仅在视频放大 2 倍或以上时使用。"

#: main.ts:347
msgid "Mode C+A (demanding): mode C with a restore pass after it. Only when the video is enlarged 2× or more."
msgstr "模式 C+A（高负载）：模式 C 之后再加一遍修复。仅在视频放大 2 倍或以上时使用。"

#: main.ts:351
msgid "HQ (demanding) runs the large networks (VL and M): about four times the work of Fast; for fast GPUs."
msgstr "高画质（高负载）运行大网络（VL 和 M）：计算量约为快速的四倍，适合较快的 GPU。"

#: main.ts:352
msgid "Fast runs the smaller networks (M and S), for most GPUs."
msgstr "快速运行较小的网络（M 和 S），适合大多数 GPU。"

#: main.ts:354
msgid "Anime4K: neural networks for anime and cartoons that restore and double the picture twice."
msgstr "Anime4K：面向动画和卡通的神经网络，修复画面并两次放大一倍。"

#: main.ts:364
msgid "Anime4K"
msgstr "Anime4K"

#: main.ts:406
msgid "Shader Upscaling…"
msgstr "着色器超分辨率…"

#: manifest.json
msgid "Shader Upscale for Vestra Player"
msgstr "Vestra Player 着色器超分辨率"

#: manifest.json
msgid "Real-time AI upscaling of anime with Anime4K's mpv GLSL shaders"
msgstr "用 Anime4K 的 mpv GLSL 着色器对动画实时 AI 超分辨率"

#: manifest.json
msgid "Sharpens and enlarges the video on the GPU while it plays, with Anime4K's neural-network shaders for mpv bundled in the plugin: six modes, Fast or HQ. Video ▸ Shader Upscaling… opens a window to choose the mode and quality, turn upscaling on and off, and see what is applied. Needs GPU rendering: macOS, or Windows with Video ▸ GPU Rendering (Experimental). Remembers your choice."
msgstr "播放时在 GPU 上锐化并放大视频，使用插件自带的 Anime4K mpv 神经网络着色器：六种模式，快速或高画质。“视频 ▸ 着色器超分辨率…”打开一个窗口，可选择模式和画质、开关超分辨率，并查看当前应用的内容。需要 GPU 渲染：macOS，或在 Windows 上打开“视频 ▸ GPU 渲染（实验性）”。会记住你的选择。"

#: manifest.json
msgid "video"
msgstr "视频"

#: manifest.json
msgid "upscaling"
msgstr "超分辨率"

#: manifest.json
msgid "shaders"
msgstr "着色器"

#: manifest.json
msgid "anime"
msgstr "动画"

